RunGoal
/ Runs the goal %goal% of the person's app (its name from the app's root: Desktop/Start), in a plang
/ of its own: what it wrote, and its exit code.
- terminal.start(App="plang", Parameter=[%goal%]); on.timeout(After="PT5M"); variable.set(Name=%ran%, Value=%!data%)
- return {output: %ran%, error: %ran!error%, code: %ran!exitCode%}
